            "objective": "Defeat the Stonehide Lawachurl",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "718030201",
                    "speaker": "Lan",
                    "text": "<color=#00E1FFFF>Ash</color>, huh... The description is detailed enough, sure, but it's not going to be easy finding a cat that's lost out in the wild."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7180303",
            "objective": "",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "718030301",
                    "speaker": "Curious Cat",
                    "text": "Meow..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030302",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Huh? Why would there be a cat here?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030303",
                    "speaker": "Curious Cat",
                    "text": "Meow... Meeeow...",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "718030304",
                            "text": "A gray cat...",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "718030305",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "A gray cat, lost in the wild..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "718030306",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Ah, Lan mentioned a commission to look for a gray cat. Maybe this is the one! Paimon remembers that it was called Ash or something like that..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "718030307",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Who'd have thought that we'd find it here... Has it been hiding around here all this time?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "718030311",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Guess the Stonehide Lawachurl prevented anyone from searching for it here, and since it was too scared to leave, it just hid."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "718030312",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Sure is lucky that we came over, or it might've had to wait for a while longer, huh?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "718030313",
                                    "speaker": "Ash",
                                    "text": "Meow... Meow, meow!",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "718030314",
                                            "text": "Meow... Meeeow...",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "718030315",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Hey, what are you doing? Paimon doesn't think it understands what you're saying anyway..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "718030316",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Let's just bring it back to Lan, and let her return it to the person who put the commission up."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "718030319",
                                                    "speaker": "Ash",
                                                    "text": "Meow... Meow! Meow!",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "718030320",
                                                            "text": "Meow... Meow! Meow!",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "718030321",
                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                    "text": "Oh, come on! It's not going to understand you no matter how hard you try to copy it. Let's just bring it with us already."
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "718030322",
                                                            "text": "It seems to agree with us.",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "718030323",
                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                    "text": "How did you even— never mind. Let's just bring it back to Lan."
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "718030317",
                                            "text": "Let's take the cat back to Lan.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "718030318",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Yup, guess that's all we can do right now. She'll return it to the person who put that commission up."
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "718030308",
                            "text": "Maybe it's Ash...",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "718030309",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "A gray cat, lost in the wild..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "718030310",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "You're right! Lan mentioned that commission earlier, didn't she? Huh. Who'd have thought that we'd find that cat here... Has it been hiding around here all this time?"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7180304",
            "objective": "Speak to the Curious Cat",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7180305",
            "objective": "Bring Ash to Lan",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "718030401",
                    "speaker": "Lan",
                    "text": "Have you defeated the Stonehide Lawachurl?",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "718030402",
                            "text": "Sure did.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "718030403",
                                    "speaker": "Lan",
                                    "text": "Thanks, you've done us a favor. With this commission under our belt, we'll have no problem proving the Guild's ability."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "718030404",
                            "text": "We defeated it, and we also found Ash...",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "718030405",
                                    "speaker": "Lan",
                                    "text": "Thanks, you've done us a fav— say what now?"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7180306",
            "objective": "",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "718030501",
                    "speaker": "Ash",
                    "text": "Meow, meow... Meow?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030502",
                    "speaker": "Lan",
                    "text": "This cat is..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030503",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "It might be Ash."
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030504",
                    "speaker": "Lan",
                    "text": "Give me a moment, let me check its features against the list of features written down in the commission."
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030505",
                    "speaker": "Lan",
                    "text": "Let's see..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030506",
                    "speaker": "Lan",
                    "text": "It mostly checks out. This seems to be the cat we're looking for."
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030508",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "The commissioner should be pleased."
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030509",
                    "speaker": "Lan",
                    "text": "Hah. After all those twists and turns, we came right back to looking for lost cats."
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030510",
                    "speaker": "Lan",
                    "text": "I'm really not sure what to say..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030511",
                    "speaker": "Lan",
                    "text": "I'll report these commissions to their commissioners. Thank you very much — please accept this as compensation for doing us this favor."
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030512",
                    "speaker": "Lan",
                    "text": "Hmm, it seems that the commissioner for the cat-related commission has since moved. It'll take some time to contact them."
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030513",
                    "speaker": "Lan",
                    "text": "Guess I'll just have to take care of this rascal in the meantime."
                },
                {
                    "id": "718030514",
                    "speaker": "Ash",
                    "text": "Meow-meow, meow!"
                }
